le of Solusek Ro","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Syllina","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Scepter","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Scepter"},{"name":"Skeletal Finger","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Skeletal_Finger"},{"name":"Hand of Shadow","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Hand_of_Shadow"},{"name":"Inky Shadow Silk","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Inky_Shadow_Silk"}],"rewards":[{"text":"ShadowBound Gloves","item":"ShadowBound Gloves","wikiPath":"/ShadowBound_Gloves"}]},{"title":"Robe of Enshroudment","wikiPath":"/ShadowBound_Armor_Quests#Robe_of_Enshroudment","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Temple of Solusek Ro","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Syllina","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"A Werebat Wing","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/A_Werebat_Wing"},{"name":"Globe of Shadow","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Globe_of_Shadow"},{"name":"Mask of Shadow","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Mask_of_Shadow"},{"name":"Large Shadow Silk","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Large_Shadow_Silk"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Robe of Enshroudment","item":"Robe of Enshroudment","wikiPath":"/Robe_of_Enshroudment"}]}],"card":{"title":"ShadowBound Armor Quests","lines":["Minimum Level: 24","Classes: Necromancer","Related Zones: Mistmoore Castle, Rathe Mountains, Lower Guk, Upper Guk, Unrest","Related NPCs: Ssynthi"]},"links":["Temple of Solusek Ro","Syllina","Necromancer","Mistmoore Castle","Rathe Mountains","Lower Guk","Upper Guk","Unrest","Ssynthi","The Temple of Solusek Ro","ShadowBound Boots","ShadowBound Gloves","Robe of Enshroudment","Reanimation Haste II","X`Ta Tempi","X`Ta Timpi","Scepter","Mistmoore","Solusek's Flower","Skeletal Toe","A Giant Skeleton","Eye of Shadow","A shadowed man","Shadow Silk","Tailoring","Gather Shadows","Silk Swatch","Shadow Wolf Pelt","Skeletal Finger","Hand of Shadow","Inky Shadow Silk","A Werebat Wing","A werebat","Globe of Shadow","A froglok nokta shaman","Ancient Crocodile","Mask of Shadow","Large Shadow Silk"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Syllina","text":"Hello, I am Syllina, follower of Solusek Ro and keeper of the [Shadow Lore]."},{"npc":"Syllina","text":"I hold the secrets to the Shadow Lore so highly prized by Necromancers. If you are interested, I can tell you about [ShadowBound Boots], [ShadowBound Gloves], the [Robe of Enshroudment] or the secrets to the making of [Shadow Silk]."},{"npc":"Syllina","text":"ShadowBound Boots are boots woven from purest shadow. If you are interested, I will weave you a pair - but I will need [boot components]."},{"npc":"Syllina","text":"I will need the following items to make you a pair of ShadowBound Boots: Shadow Silk, The Scepter of Sorrow from Castle Mistmoore, an Eye of Shadow from our mortal enemies the Shadowed Men and a Skeletal toe from a Rathe Giant Skeleton."},{"npc":"Syllina","text":"ShadowBound Gloves are gloves woven from the purest shadow. If you are interested, I will weave you a pair - but I will need [glove components]."},{"npc":"Syllina","text":"I will need the following items to make you a pair of ShadowBound Gloves: Inky Shadow Silk, The Scepter of Tears from the circle-stair-waterfall of Guk, a Hand of Shadow from our mortal enemies the Shadowed Men and a Skeletal finger from a Rathe Giant Skeleton."},{"npc":"Syllina","text":"The Robe of Enshroudment is a robe woven from the purest of shadow. If you are interested, I will weave you a robe - but I will need the following [robe components]."},{"npc":"Syllina","text":"I will need the following items to make you a Robe of Enshroudment: Large Shadow Silk, A Werebat Wing from the Estate of Unrest, A Mask of Shadow from our mortal enemies the Shadowed Men and a Globe of Shadow from a Nokta Shaman in Guk."},{"npc":"Syllina","text":"If you are interested, I will tell you the secrets of making Shadow Silk for a mere 50 pieces of gold."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:35:34.950Z","outOfEra":false}
